      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "Your experience of hearing dismissive responses about your grief is a common feeling for those living with depression, and that added guilt only deepens the isolation. This \"nothingness\" is a physical sensation caused by a chemical imbalance, not a sign that your emotions are invalid or that you are failing. Please reach out to a therapist who specializes in this specific type of suffering, as finding a specialist is the most effective way to finally break the fog holding you back.",
      "source": "target",
